### LexiLearn Student Dashboard API Tests
### Use this file with REST Client extension in VS Code

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@token = YOUR_CLERK_TOKEN_HERE

###############################################
# Student Dashboard Endpoints
###############################################

### 1. Get Complete Dashboard Data (Recommended)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/student/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2. Get Stats Only (Header)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/student/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 3. Get Recent Lessons (Default: 3)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/student/recent-lessons
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 4. Get Recent Lessons (Custom Limit)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/student/recent-lessons?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 5. Get Practice History (Last 7 Days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/student/practice-history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 6. Get Practice History (Custom Days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/student/practice-history?days=14
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 7. Get Next Lesson
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/student/next-lesson
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

###############################################
# Complete Dashboard Flow Test
###############################################

### Step 1: Get complete dashboard on page load
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/student/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Step 2: Refresh only stats (e.g., after completing a lesson)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/student/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Step 3: Get next lesson info
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/student/next-lesson
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

